% Cassegrain with its obscuring element (elt 2, declared IndRef= 1.0) between
% two flat glass faces (elt 1 into n=1.5, elt 3 back to 1.0).  CTRACE's
% Obscuring branch used to stamp the RUNNING medium (1.5) onto the obscuring
% element's IndRef during a trace -- nothing reads it as a medium, so the stamp
% only MUTATED the prescription (SHOW / SAVE after a trace).  GATE: SHOW 2
% after an OPD still reports IndRef 1.0 (cli_tests/cmd/IndRef_stamp.jou).

